<p class="text-base mb-4" id="subtitle"></p>
<div class="relative" id="map-wrap">
  <div id="map-container"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-6 left-6 max-[480px]:top-3 max-[480px]:left-3" id="map-variant-picker">
    <select class="bg-surface border border-field-border rounded-app px-[.6rem] py-[.35rem] max-[480px]:px-[.4rem] max-[480px]:py-[.25rem] text-foreground text-sm max-[480px]:text-xs outline-none cursor-pointer hover:border-accent focus:border-accent" id="map-variant-select" aria-label="Map projection">
      <option value="greenwich">Greenwich</option>
      <option value="americas">Americas</option>
      <option value="oceania">Oceania</option>
    </select>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute top-6 right-6 max-[480px]:top-3 max-[480px]:right-3 flex flex-col gap-[.35rem] max-[480px]:gap-[.25rem]" id="map-zoom-controls" hidden>
    <button type="button" class="w-8 h-8 max-[480px]:w-6 max-[480px]:h-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-surface border border-border rounded-app text-foreground text-lg max-[480px]:text-sm font-bold leading-none cursor-pointer hover:border-accent disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" id="map-zoom-in" aria-label="Zoom in">+</button>
    <button type="button" class="w-8 h-8 max-[480px]:w-6 max-[480px]:h-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-surface border border-border rounded-app text-foreground text-lg max-[480px]:text-sm font-bold leading-none cursor-pointer hover:border-accent disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" id="map-zoom-out" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 max-[480px]:bottom-3 max-[480px]:right-3 grid grid-cols-3 grid-rows-3 gap-[2px] w-[84px] h-[84px] max-[480px]:w-[64px] max-[480px]:h-[64px]" id="map-pan-controls" hidden>
    <button type="button" class="col-start-2 row-start-1 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-surface border border-border rounded-app text-foreground text-sm max-[480px]:text-xs leading-none cursor-pointer hover:border-accent disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" id="map-pan-up" aria-label="Pan up">▲</button>
    <button type="button" class="col-start-1 row-start-2 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-surface border border-border rounded-app text-foreground text-sm max-[480px]:text-xs leading-none cursor-pointer hover:border-accent disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" id="map-pan-left" aria-label="Pan left">◀</button>
    <button type="button" class="col-start-3 row-start-2 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-surface border border-border rounded-app text-foreground text-sm max-[480px]:text-xs leading-none cursor-pointer hover:border-accent disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" id="map-pan-right" aria-label="Pan right">▶</button>
    <button type="button" class="col-start-2 row-start-3 inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-surface border border-border rounded-app text-foreground text-sm max-[480px]:text-xs leading-none cursor-pointer hover:border-accent disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" id="map-pan-down" aria-label="Pan down">▼</button>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-muted leading-[1.6] mt-3">This map uses the <a class="text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-2" href="https://equal-earth.com/equal-earth-projection.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Equal Earth projection ↗</a> instead of the more common Mercator, which inflates countries near the poles (mostly the Global North) while shrinking those near the equator (mostly the Global South) — Greenland, for instance, appears larger than Africa on Mercator despite being 14 times smaller. Equal Earth is equal-area throughout, so every country's size on the map reflects its true relative size. Powered by <a class="text-accent-ink underline underline-offset-2" href="https://d3js.org/d3-geo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">d3-geo ↗</a>, a free library for exactly this kind of thing.</p>
